  "code" : "public int maxNonAdjacentSum(int[] nums) {\n    int n = nums.length;\n    int[] best = new int[n];\n    best[0] = nums[0];\n    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++) {\n        int take = nums[i] + (i > 1 ? best[i - 2] : 0);\n        int skip = best[i - 1];\n        best[i] = Math.max(take, skip);\n    }\n    return best[n - 1];\n}",
